<title>FRANCE: Seita Q1 sales up 0.8 percent.</title>
<headline>Seita Q1 sales up 0.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 4,051    vs    4,018</p>
<p>NOTE - Seita said in a statement that an 8.7 percent rise in Seita tobacco product prices in December had only partially compensated a 12.7 percent fall in sales volume due to competition by low-priced products.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
